{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂1の乃木坂ヲタク\nかりんの発音 上り坂↑\n伊藤かりん↑です(っｴ`o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/12/01/4558365/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46 2014年流行語大賞"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"を決めたいと思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大賞は単純に、票が多かったもの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂に関連ある言葉なら\nなんでも大丈夫ですー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"思い思いの流行語を\nみんなコメントしてね～♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうご存知の方も\nいらっしゃるかと思いますが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"12/29発売の2月号より\n「将棋世界」さんにて連載を\nスタートさせて頂くことになりました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"将棋初心者であり伸び悩んでいる私に\n先生を呼んで上達しよう(๑•̀‧̫•́๑)\nという企画です♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お世話になる先生は\n戸辺誠六段です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とっても優しく丁寧に\n教えてくださりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/12/01/4558365/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は今年の成人式の取材の際\n目標を聞かれて、\nレギュラーを持つこと！\nと答えていました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/12/01/4558365/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"目標って、叶わないくらいのものが\nいいと思っていて、\nその時まだ研究生だった私にとって\n叶わないであろう目標を掲げました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもそれを叶えることができました！\nしかも自分の好きな事で\n連載が出来るなんて夢のような話"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/12/01/4558365/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これは\nいつも応援してくださっている\nファンのみなさん\n私のことを支えてくださってる\nスタッフのみなさんのおかげです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとうございます✳︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"感謝の気持ちを忘れずに\n成長していければいいなと思うので\nみなさんお楽しみに"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/12/01/4558365/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/12/01/4558365/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/12/01/4558365/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いおり"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/12/01/4558365/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"純奈"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/12/01/4558365/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誕生日が私の指定した日(13日ごと)\nの方のみ僭越ながら\nお祝いさせていただきます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/12/01/4558365/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"11.30 birthday!!!!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"優奈ちゃん\nめぐみさん\nひささん\nとし兄さん\nひろみさん\nふみかちゃんの弟さん\nF.Iさん\nリトモさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私たちと一緒に素敵な1年に\nしましょうね"},{"type":"image","src":"https:/